       AUDIT-EXCESS-0060.
               EXEC CICS ASKTIME ABSTIME(ABS-TIME)
               END-EXEC.
               EXEC CICS FORMATTIME ABSTIME(ABS-TIME)
                         MMDDYYYY(DATE1)
                         TIME(TIME1)
               END-EXEC.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       NORMALISE-MAKE-0061.
               EXEC CICS ASKTIME ABSTIME(ABS-TIME)
               END-EXEC.
